   "body": {
    "language": "st",
    "value": "(* THE HMI'S DEVELOPER PAGE, WITH THE PLC RUNNING. robocnc takes axis commands only from the\n   PLC while one is linked (TCPModbusServer::writeIsProtected), so the page asks here and this\n   program passes them on -- the way NC_LINK_OUT drives the pumps, through the same blocks. Nothing\n   moves while a program runs, the emergency stop is pressed or a fault has stopped the machine;\n   a stop is always taken. A program of its own, called by the task after PLC_PRG, so the\n   original programs are unchanged.\n\n   THE MAILBOX (written by the HMI, by name):\n     DevCmdSeq   bumped for each command; DevCmd, DevCmdAxis, DevCmdTarget/Vel/Acc its words.\n                 DevCmd: robocnc's axis codes 10 enable, 99 disable, 20 home, 80 stop, 91 clear\n                 fault, 100 move relative, 101 move absolute (machine coordinates); for every\n                 axis 0..DevAxisCount-1: 1010 enable, 1099 disable, 1080 stop, 1000 home all\n                 (robocnc's own order, axes.json home_order).\n     DevAckSeq   = DevCmdSeq once taken; DevResult 0 done, 1 a program is running, 2 the\n                 emergency stop, 3 the machine is stopped by a fault (Reset first), 4 not a\n                 command / no such axis, 5 robocnc is not linked.\n     DevJog*     the held jogs, per axis (the joystick moves X and Y together): DevJogDir[a]\n                 (-1/0/+1), DevJogTarget[a] (where it runs to: the end of travel), DevJogVel[a],\n                 DevJogAcc[a]; and DevJogAlive, renewed by the page while anything is held: 500 ms\n                 without a renewal and every jog stops (a closed browser cannot leave one running).\n                 A speed changed by more than 4 % (the joystick's deflection) issues the move again.\n     DevTeachSeq, DevTeachId  set a position to where the tool tip is now (P0..P2: the actual\n                 position less the active tool, robocnc's TCP). Kept (RETAIN) and sent to robocnc\n                 as the program parameter it feeds. DevTeachAck/Result as above, DevTeachX/Y/Z\n                 the values taken. Ids: 1 waste, 2 wet cleaning, 3 maintenance, 4 manual\n                 dispensing, 5 calibration, 6 table 1 reference (S1), 7 table 2 reference (S2),\n                 8 home position (X, Y: its Z is the machine's top less the tool), 9 flow\n                 regulation height (Z). *)\nIF first THEN\n\tfirst := FALSE;\n\tlast_seq := DevCmdSeq;\n\tlast_teach := DevTeachSeq;\n\talive_last := DevJogAlive;\nEND_IF;\n\nIF NOT CncLinkOk THEN refuse := 5;\nELSIF NcProgramRunning THEN refuse := 1;\nELSIF NOT EmergencyOK THEN refuse := 2;\nELSIF NcFaultStop THEN refuse := 3;\nELSE refuse := 0;\nEND_IF;\n\n(* ---- one command ---- *)\nIF DevCmdSeq <> last_seq THEN\n\tlast_seq := DevCmdSeq;\n\tres := refuse;\n\t(* a stop is always taken, a program running or not *)\n\tIF (DevCmd = 80 OR DevCmd = 1080) AND CncLinkOk THEN res := 0; END_IF;\n\ta := DevCmdAxis;\n\tIF res = 0 THEN\n\t\tIF DevCmd = 10 OR DevCmd = 99 OR DevCmd = 20 OR DevCmd = 80 OR DevCmd = 91 THEN\n\t\t\tIF a < 0 OR a > 15 THEN\n\t\t\t\tres := 4;\n\t\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\t(* robocnc acts on a CHANGE of the word: the same command again is preceded by a stop *)\n\t\t\t\tIF last_word[a] = DevCmd AND DevCmd <> 80 THEN ax(ID := a, CMD := 80); END_IF;\n\t\t\t\tax(ID := a, CMD := DevCmd);\n\t\t\t\tlast_word[a] := DevCmd;\n\t\t\tEND_IF;\n\t\tELSIF DevCmd = 100 OR DevCmd = 101 THEN\n\t\t\tIF a < 0 OR a > 15 THEN\n\t\t\t\tres := 4;\n\t\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\twp_t(ADDR := 3000 + 2 * a, VALUE := DevCmdTarget);\n\t\t\t\twp_v(ADDR := 3100 + 2 * a, VALUE := DevCmdVel);\n\t\t\t\twp_a(ADDR := 3200 + 2 * a, VALUE := DevCmdAcc);\n\t\t\t\tIF last_word[a] = DevCmd THEN ax(ID := a, CMD := 80); END_IF;\n\t\t\t\tax(ID := a, CMD := DevCmd);\n\t\t\t\tlast_word[a] := DevCmd;\n\t\t\tEND_IF;\n\t\tELSIF DevCmd = 1000 THEN\n\t\t\twp_home(ADDR := 2068, VALUE := 1);\n\t\tELSIF DevCmd = 1010 OR DevCmd = 1099 OR DevCmd = 1080 THEN\n\t\t\tc := DevCmd - 1000;\n\t\t\tFOR k := 0 TO 15 DO\n\t\t\t\tIF k < DevAxisCount THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tIF last_word[k] = c AND c <> 80 THEN ax(ID := k, CMD := 80); END_IF;\n\t\t\t\t\tax(ID := k, CMD := c);\n\t\t\t\t\tlast_word[k] := c;\n\t\t\t\tEND_IF;\n\t\t\tEND_FOR;\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tres := 4;\n\t\tEND_IF;\n\tEND_IF;\n\tDevResult := res;\n\tDevAckSeq := last_seq;\nEND_IF;\n\n(* ---- the held jogs: a move to the end of travel while the page renews it ---- *)\nIF DevJogAlive <> alive_last THEN\n\talive_last := DevJogAlive;\n\tlease(IN := FALSE, PT := T#500ms);\nEND_IF;\nlease(IN := TRUE, PT := T#500ms);\nFOR k := 0 TO 15 DO\n\twant := DevJogDir[k] <> 0 AND DevJogVel[k] > 0.0 AND NOT lease.Q AND refuse = 0;\n\tIF jog_on[k] AND NOT want THEN\n\t\tax(ID := k, CMD := 80);\n\t\tlast_word[k] := 80;\n\t\tjog_on[k] := FALSE;\n\tEND_IF;\n\tagain := jog_on[k] AND want AND (DevJogDir[k] <> jog_d[k] OR DevJogTarget[k] <> jog_t[k]\n\t         OR ABS(DevJogVel[k] - jog_v[k]) > 0.04 * jog_v[k]);\n\tIF want AND (NOT jog_on[k] OR again) THEN\n\t\tjog_d[k] := DevJogDir[k];\n\t\tjog_t[k] := DevJogTarget[k];\n\t\tjog_v[k] := DevJogVel[k];\n\t\twp_t(ADDR := 3000 + 2 * k, VALUE := DevJogTarget[k]);\n\t\twp_v(ADDR := 3100 + 2 * k, VALUE := DevJogVel[k]);\n\t\twp_a(ADDR := 3200 + 2 * k, VALUE := DevJogAcc[k]);\n\t\tIF last_word[k] = 101 THEN ax(ID := k, CMD := 80); END_IF;\n\t\tax(ID := k, CMD := 101);\n\t\tlast_word[k] := 101;\n\t\tjog_on[k] := TRUE;\n\tEND_IF;\nEND_FOR;\n\n(* ---- set a position to where the tool tip is ---- *)\nIF DevTeachSeq <> last_teach THEN\n\tlast_teach := DevTeachSeq;\n\tx := P_VAL[0];\n\ty := P_VAL[1];\n\tz := P_VAL[2];\n\tIF NOT CncLinkOk THEN\n\t\tres := 5;\n\tELSIF NcProgramRunning THEN\n\t\tres := 1;\n\tELSE\n\t\tres := 0;\n\t\tCASE DevTeachId OF\n\t\t\t1:\n\t\t\t\tWastePositionXCoordinate := x; WastePositionYCoordinate := y; WastePositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1811] := x; P_VAL[1812] := y; P_VAL[1813] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1811] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1812] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1813] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t2:\n\t\t\t\tCleaningPositionXCoordinate := x; CleaningPositionYCoordinate := y; CleaningPositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1801] := x; P_VAL[1802] := y; P_VAL[1803] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1801] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1802] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1803] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t3:\n\t\t\t\tMaintenancePositionXCoordinate := x; MaintenancePositionYCoordinate := y; MaintenancePositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1821] := x; P_VAL[1822] := y; P_VAL[1823] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1821] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1822] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1823] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t4:\n\t\t\t\tManuelDispensingPositionXCoordinate := x; ManuelDispensingPositionYCoordinate := y;\n\t\t\t\tManuelDispensingPositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1831] := x; P_VAL[1832] := y; P_VAL[1833] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1831] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1832] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1833] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t5:\n\t\t\t\tCalibrationPositionXCoordinate := x; CalibrationPositionYCoordinate := y; CalibrationPositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1841] := x; P_VAL[1842] := y; P_VAL[1843] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1841] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1842] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1843] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t6:\n\t\t\t\tS1XOffset := x; S1YOffset := y; S1ZOffset := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1845] := x; P_VAL[1846] := y; P_VAL[1847] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1845] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1846] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1847] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t7:\n\t\t\t\tS2XOffset := x; S2YOffset := y; S2ZOffset := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1848] := x; P_VAL[1849] := y; P_VAL[1850] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1848] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1849] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1850] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t8:\n\t\t\t\tHomePositionXCoordinate := x; HomePositionYCoordinate := y;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1816] := x; P_VAL[1817] := y;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1816] := TRUE; P_DIRTY[1817] := TRUE;\n\t\t\t9:\n\t\t\t\tFlowRegulationPositionZCoordinate := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_VAL[1815] := z;\n\t\t\t\tP_DIRTY[1815] := TRUE;\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tres := 4;\n\t\tEND_CASE;\n\tEND_IF;\n\tDevTeachX := x;\n\tDevTeachY := y;\n\tDevTeachZ := z;\n\tDevTeachResult := res;\n\tDevTeachAck := last_teach;\nEND_IF;"
   },
   "documentation": ""
  },
